        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Offset Arm and Track for Concealed Overhead Closers</b>\r\n<p>For doors with 5/8\" shallow top rails. Replacement Jackson #20-1134LC Offset Arm Set. Mortise Type Track with spring loaded backstop. Nylon slide guide is reversible for 90 or 105 degree door opening. \r\n</p> \r\n<p>\r\nFor <a href=\"/products/adjustable-spring-ada-compliant-double-acting-concealed-overhead-door-closer-global-tc7010\"><b>Global TC7010 Series</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/light-3-spring-double-acting-concealed-overhead-door-closer-global-tc7020\"><b>Global TC7020 Series</b></a>,\r\n<a href=\"/products/medium-4-spring-double-acting-concealed-overhead-door-closer-jackson-20-330-replace\"><b>Global TC7030 Series</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/heavy-5-spring-double-acting-concealed-overhead-door-closer-global-tc7040\"><b>Global TC7040 Series</b></a> and other manufactures replacements for <a href=\"/products/replace-jackson-20-330-concealed-overhead-closer-assembly\"><b>Jackson 20-330</b></a>  Style concealed door closers including the International 200 series.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/global-offset-arm2_size.gif?v=1704354569\" width=\"510\" height=\"180\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Global Door Controls Offset-Arm-2 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/tc7000-series-jackson-20-330-offset-arm-and-track\"><b>Offset Arm for Deep Top Rail</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>Specifications:</b> for Global Offset Arm and Track\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>Track Length: 12-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Track Width Outside: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Track Depth Outside: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/20-1134LC.pdf?v=1704262242\" target=\"new\"><b>Offset Arm and Track Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold as a Set</b> - 1 Arm, 1 Track Assembly with nylon guide, plus machine  screws.\r\n</p>",
